sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Customer (UI)
  participant O as Order Svc
  participant R as Restaurant Svc
  participant P as Payment Svc
  participant D as Delivery Svc
  participant N as Notification Svc
  C->>O: POST /orders
  O-->>R: orders.created
  R->>R: check hours, lock and reserve stock
  R-->>O: orders.validated (priced items)
  O->>O: delivery fee = distance x surge
  O-->>P: payments.requested
  P-->>O: payments.completed
  O-->>R: orders.confirmed (kitchen queue)
  O-->>D: orders.confirmed
  D->>D: nearest driver + Dijkstra route
  D-->>O: delivery.assigned
  R-->>O: kitchen.preparing / kitchen.ready
  O-->>D: orders.status.changed (READY)
  D-->>O: delivery.picked_up
  D-->>D: delivery.location.updated (GPS sim)
  D-->>O: delivery.completed
  O-->>N: orders.status.changed (every step)
  N->>C: SMS / EMAIL / PUSH
